? Transparency about technical debt helps stakeholders understand trade-offs and support time to address it.

@@ PE7 | Predictive
Important lessons from a classified defence project would help other programmes, but the details are classified. What should be done?
A) Prepare sanitised lessons and share them through approved channels
B) Share the full lessons informally with trusted colleagues
