@@ PE8 | Predictive | fill
After new members joined, the number of communication channels in a project team rose from 28 to 45. How many people joined the team? (Answer with a number.)
= 2
? Channels = n(n − 1)/2. 28 channels means 8 people (8 × 7 / 2), and 45 channels means 10 people (10 × 9 / 2). So 2 people joined.

